            <h1>Wild Waters Rafting</h1>
            <article>
                <h2>Our Adventure Story</h2>
                <img src="images/happy-rafters.avif" alt="Happy rafters enjoying the river"
                  width="200" height="150">
                <p>Experience the thrill of untamed rivers, the beauty of nature, and the joy of
                    shared adventure. At Wild Waters, we believe that every rapid tells a story and
                    every journey creates unforgettable bonds. Our expert guides, top-notch
                    equipment, and passion for the outdoors ensure your adventure is safe, exciting,
                    and truly wild.</p>
            </article>
        </div>

        <section class="history">
            <h2>History</h2>
            <div class="history-content">
                <p>Founded in 2010 by passionate river enthusiasts, Wild Waters Rafting began with a
                    single raft and a dream to share the exhilarating experience of whitewater
                    rafting. What started as weekend trips on the South Fork river quickly grew into
                    a full-fledged adventure company. Over the years, we have expanded our fleet,
                    trained a team of the most skilled and safety-conscious guides, and earned a
                    reputation for delivering exceptional experiences. Our commitment to
                    environmental stewardship and community engagement remains at the core of our
                    operations.</p>
                <img src="images/early-days.avif" alt="Early days of Wild Waters Rafting"
                  width="300" height="200">
                <p>Today, we operate on multiple rivers across the region, offering trips for
                    beginners to seasoned adventurers. Our legacy is built on countless smiles,
                    shared laughter, and the unwavering belief that the river is for everyone. We
                    continue to innovate while preserving the wild spirit that inspired our
                    founders. Join us as we write the next chapter of our story—one rapid at a time.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

